<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan platinum imports surge 63.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan platinum imports surge 63.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in January surged 63.6 percent from a year earlier to 7.10 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.  </p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Jan 97    Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p> Total		7.10	6.59	  4.34</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	     1.17	2.10	  1.28</p>
<p> South Africa     3.98	2.69	  1.91</p>
<p>Total imports in 1996 were 72.02 tonnes, off slightly from 72.58 tonnes the year before.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
